    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Glimpses of the future begin to press on your awareness. Whenever you finish a Long Rest, roll two d20s and record the numbers rolled. You can replace any D20 Test made by you or a creature you can see with one of these foretelling rolls. You must choose to do so before the roll, and you can replace a roll this way only once per turn. Each foretelling roll can be used only once, and when you finish a Long Rest, you lose any unused foretelling rolls.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-hQqHq7pDspp5nW3g\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Note your foretelling rolls; the uses are the rolls you have left.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
